WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.803
Watch and read: Which word rhymes with “cat”?

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.869
The answer is: hat. cat and hat have similar ending sounds.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.177
Watch and read: Which is the correctly written familiar word?

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:16.745
The answer is: the. Look carefully at the letters from left to right.
